<article class="env-lemma" id="0GWP">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0GWP">Lemma <span data-tag="0GWP">15.59.3</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. The homotopy category $K(R)$ of complexes of $R$-modules endowed with the functor $(L^\bullet , M^\bullet ) \mapsto \text{Tot}(L^\bullet \otimes _ R M^\bullet )$ and associativity and commutativity constraints as above is a symmetric monoidal category. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
